30:Stage one is implemented: amounts above USD 500,000 return a two-person-workflow-unavailable conflict without changes. Two-person approval is a later stage. Positive USD amounts must be numeric whole cents (trailing zeros accepted); fractional cents are rejected without rounding. All lifecycle changes are atomic and repository results are detached snapshots. Restart and sign in again after migrating accounts, since existing sessions retain their roles. The creation form preserves the entered numeric value exactly in JSON, including trailing zeros and fractional cents; the server validates it without rounding. Displayed amounts still use JavaScript numbers and can be approximate for very large values.
